 * jQuery.imgBox
 * Yet another lightbox alternative.
 *
 * Initial release by jQueryGlobe.
 *
 * v2.x by Tsachi Shlidor (@shlidor).
 *
 * Version: 2.0.0-rc1 (09/02/2013).
